   "value": "<p><em>Shrine — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>Beginning at 11th level, your body has adjusted to better handle your cursed technique. You can now use <em>Dismantle</em> as a bonus action or reaction (one attack each). Additionally, when using <em>Cleave</em> against a creature that has failed its save, it treats immunity as resistance. If using the maximum of 10 cursed energy on <em>Cleave</em>, you can target a limb from the limb damage table.</p>",
